Comprehensive CSS Refactoring Plan The objective is to eliminate inline style attributes across all website views,
moving them to gifter.css . This will improve maintainability,
consistency,
and separation of concerns. Proposed Changes [Component] Global Stylesheets [MODIFY] gifter.css Add the following utility and component classes:

/* Typography & Spacing */
.text-xs {
    font-size: 0.625rem;
}

.text-sm {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
}

.text-base {
    font-size: 1rem;
}

.text-lg {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
}

.text-xl {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
}

.text-2xl {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
}

.ls-tight {
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
}

/* Layout Containers */
.logo-container {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
}

/* Buttons & Interactive */
.nav-link-btn {
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(36, 36, 36, 0.5);
}

.user-dropdown-btn {
    padding: 6px 12px 6px 6px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(36, 36, 36, 0.5);
    border: none;
}

.btn-primary-glow {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: var(--primary-foreground);
    position: relative;
}

.btn-primary-glow::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: inherit;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--primary), var(--accent), var(--primary));
    opacity: 0.4;
    filter: blur(8px);
    z-index: -1;
}

/* Card & Bento improvements */
.bento-icon-wrapper {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    background: var(--secondary);
    border-radius: 1rem;
}

.bento-image-placeholder {
    height: 96px;
    background: rgba(36, 36, 36, 0.5);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
}

/* Status Badges */
.badge-published {
    background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2);
    color: #4ade80;
}

.badge-draft {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    color: #8c8c8c;
}

.badge-category {
    background: rgba(0, 170, 255, 0.2);
    color: var(--primary);
}

/* Category Buttons (Dashboard) */
.category-btn {
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    background: rgba(36, 36, 36, 0.5);
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
}

.category-btn.active {
    background: rgba(0, 170, 255, 0.1);
    border-color: var(--primary);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 170, 255, 0.4);
}

